    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Room231</h2><i>Backroom: Room231</i> is a <strong>&quot;hardcore&quot;</strong> single player horror game, which is based on the famous creepy pasta called &quot;Backrooms&quot;. In this game, you will need to find an exit of level231 while hiding from dangerous environments and entities. However, you will need to find every &quot;<i>objects</i>&quot; from other levels of backrooms to open the exit of level231.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncanny Rooms</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737100/extras/3a03efc264c69df92211dbc69ac086a2.avif?t=1709188916\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br>Currently, <i>Room231</i> has 9 levels. Level231 is a main level, which is the beginning and end map for the player's escape. It is a familiar place, but becareful. Uncanny experiences are waiting for you. There are 6 more levels that have &quot;objects&quot; which must placed in the right location in level231. While collecting these objects, player will be able to reach the truth of level231 and exit to live. <br>These are current levels:<br><strong>1</strong>- Level 231<br><strong>2</strong>- Level 6<br><strong>3</strong>- Level 34<br><strong>4</strong>- Level Maze(Original level)<br><strong>5</strong>- Level 19<br><strong>6</strong>- Level 69<br><strong>7</strong>- Level 7<br><strong>8</strong>- Level Bathroom(Original level)<br><strong>9</strong>- Level Forest(Original level)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Entities</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737100/extras/c6af3431b50194ffb9256d48a70204e4.avif?t=1709188916\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br>During your uncanny adventure, you will meet several entities. Some of them are based on the original backrooms, others are this game's original entities. Each entities have different patterns and gimmicks, so you would better to know that and find best way to esacpe from those.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles&amp;Items</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737100/extras/201c1cd3f21a3f1f3e0317793fd79567.avif?t=1709188916\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br>You will need to solve lots of puzzles during your journey for reach to every exits of backrooms. Each puzzles have unique and interesting gimmicks which requires you to think creatively. And to solve puzzles, to live, to hide from entities, you can use lots of items and tools. You can save them in their inventory, or hold them with hand. <strong>Those puzzles are quite hard to solve, so be prepare to wake up your brain. </strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jumpscares</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737100/extras/aaef3e63da7384865b4a2c797b66a8cb.avif?t=1709188916\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br>You will see some jumpscares in this game. Especially in early 30~ minutes of the game. <strong>Don't forget to massage your heart before playing this.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Updates</h2>This game is still in development, so there might be some glitches&amp;bugs.<br>Since I am a solo developer, it is hard to guarantee fast updates and reponses, but I will keep update <i>Room231</i> and communicate with you guys for best creepy experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feel free to broadcast&amp;make videos with this game</strong></h2>If you encounter any issues&amp;bugs feel free to send me: <strong><a href=\"mailto:dudwlstldud@gmail.com\">dudwlstldud@gmail.com</a></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737100/extras/4e8bb0ff0ac4432e8a5bce463f165fed.avif?t=1709188916\" width=557 height=116 /></span>",
